{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37983","headline":"辛酉岁冬十一月随驾幸岐下作 · 韩偓","name":"辛酉岁冬十一月随驾幸岐下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"曳裾谈笑殿西头，忽听征铙从冕旒。\n凤盖行时移紫气，鸾旗驻处认皇州。\n晓题御服颁羣吏，夜发宫嫔诏列侯。\n雨露涵濡三百载，不知谁拟杀身酬。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩偓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}